Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:34:36 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] webshare/truesearch: no TNC start_blocker, no
 WEBSHARE/TRUESEARCH entitlement or index-dataset gate (awto-unvr #357)

- webshare.start_blocker returns None: awto-webshare serves its own TLS cert
- sharing.webshare validate skips truenas.entitlements.check(WEBSHARE)
- truesearch.unavailable_reasons returns []: awto truesearchd needs no index dataset or entitlement
- entitlement matrix/engine untouched
